# NetCoop AI Frontend Environment Variables
# In production on Vercel/Netlify/Render, set VITE_API_BASE_URL to your backend URL (e.g. https://netcoop-ai-backend.onrender.com)
# In local development, leave blank to use the Vite proxy defined in vite.config.js (proxies /api and /health to http://127.0.0.1:8000)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
